# Analysis repository for ~/Physics/Overcharged (whitelist): code, notes, LaTeX, run inputs, result tables and report figures.
# The solver lives in its own repo (niamh-overcharged/); simulation outputs are backed up to OneDrive (backup/backup_overcharged.sh), not here.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
# code
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.wl
!*.nb
# notes and text
!*.md
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.sty
!*.cls
# run inputs, queues, manifests
!input.json
!jobs*.txt
!*.tsv
# analysis result tables (reports/ and results/ only)
!reports/**/*.txt
!results/**/*.txt
# figures needed to compile the LaTeX reports
!reports/*/figs/*.png
!reports/*/figs/*.pdf
!reports/master/figs/**
# excluded even if they match above
niamh-overcharged/
mpcd/
bin/
backup/logs/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
# presentation (reveal.js deck; vendored reveal kept so the deck works from a clone; movie and zip excluded)
!reports/presentation/*.html
!reports/presentation/reveal/**
